## Why This Is Asked
This question assesses your ability to align cost, risk, and velocity in a multi-team, multi-region environment with shared data platform infrastructure.

## Key Concepts
- FinOps and cost governance in cloud-native environments
- SLOs/SLIs and error budget policies
- Multi-tenancy isolation and privacy controls
- Budgeting, chargeback, and ownership models
- Incident costing and blameless postmortems
- Experiments to validate operational readiness

## Code Example
```javascript
// Tagging for cost ownership
function tagResource(resource, owner, project) {
  return {
    ...resource,
    tags: {
      owner: owner,
      project: project,
      costCenter: getCostCenter(owner),
      environment: process.env.ENV
    }
  };
}
```
